      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Casting Mox Opal from the graveyard via Emry when there's already a Mox Opal on the battlefield triggers the legend rule, forcing one to be sacrificed. The only benefit is a +1/+1 counter on Patchwork Automaton, but this wastes Emry's tap for the turn. Emry could have targeted Lotus Petal instead for the same Patchwork trigger plus an extra artifact/mana.",
